1
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:29,580
王建川: Hoàng Sơn năm ấy, ta ngồi chung một chuyến,
That year in Huangshan, we shared the same journey.

2
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:37,080
劉毅: Đâu ngờ một lần gặp... thương đến hết đời.
Little did we know, a single encounter would become a love to last a lifetime.

3
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:56,920
王建川: Tôi từng có anh, từng có những ngày yên ấm,
I once had you, once knew the warmth of peaceful days together.

4
00:00:56,920 --> 00:01:03,860
王建川: Mà chính tay mình... đánh mất ngày mai.
Yet with my own hands... I destroyed the future we could have shared.

5
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:08,520
王建川: Tôi mượn chia lìa làm lời che chở,
I disguised our parting as an act of protection.

6
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:12,180
王建川: Năm năm ấy... chưa một ngày thôi nhớ.
Through those five long years... not a single day passed without longing for you.

7
00:01:12,630 --> 00:01:15,540
王建川: Tôi đã nghĩ, chỉ cần anh bình yên,
I once believed that as long as you were safe and at peace,

8
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:21,620
王建川: Dẫu đời tôi... chẳng còn nơi trở lại.
It wouldn't matter if I... had nowhere left to return to.

9
00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:27,620
劉毅: Anh có biết tôi đã đau đến thế nào?
Do you know how deeply I suffered?

10
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:34,740
劉毅: Đứng giữa mùa xuân... mà lòng như tuyết phủ.
I stood in the midst of spring... yet my heart lay buried beneath the snow.

11
00:01:35,940 --> 00:01:39,960
劉毅: Tôi chẳng cần một người thay mình chịu khổ,
I never needed someone to bear my suffering in my place.

12
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:42,780
劉毅: Chỉ cần anh... đừng giấu tôi điều gì.
All I needed was for you... to keep nothing hidden from me.

13
00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:46,020
劉毅: Tôi đợi năm năm, đâu phải để từ biệt,
I waited five years, not merely to say goodbye.

14
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:50,060
劉毅: Tôi cần một mái nhà... có anh trong đó.
All I wanted was a home... with you in it.

15
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:58,620
王建川: Tôi xin lỗi... vì đã để anh cô độc.
I'm sorry... for leaving you to face those lonely years alone.

16
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:05,440
劉毅: Tôi giận anh... vì chẳng chịu cùng tôi đau.
I was angry with you... for refusing to let me share your pain.

17
00:02:06,730 --> 00:02:12,700
王建川: Nếu còn có thể, xin cho tôi ở lại.
If there's still a chance... please let me stay.

18
00:02:12,700 --> 00:02:19,840
劉毅: Vậy từ hôm nay... đừng rời tay nhau.
Then from this day forward... let us never let go of each other's hands.

19
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:23,860
王建川 × 劉毅: Đừng lấy chia lìa làm lời che chở,
Let us never again disguise separation as protection.

20
00:02:23,860 --> 00:02:27,360
王建川 × 劉毅: Đừng tự mình đi hết những đêm đau.
Let neither of us endure those nights of sorrow alone.

21
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:30,780
王建川 × 劉毅: Năm năm ấy, hai người cùng thương nhớ,
For five long years, we both ached with longing for each other.

22
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:34,380
王建川 × 劉毅: Mà cứ ngỡ... lòng nhau đã đổi thay.
Yet each believed... the other's heart had changed.

23
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:37,400
王建川 × 劉毅: Nếu mai này còn bao nhiêu giông bão,
No matter how many storms the coming days may bring,

24
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:41,240
王建川 × 劉毅: Xin cùng nhau... đi hết những tháng ngày.
Let us walk through all the days ahead... side by side.

25
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:44,240
王建川 × 劉毅: Tình yêu đâu chỉ là khi hạnh phúc,
Love is not only found in moments of happiness.

26
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:49,980
王建川 × 劉毅: Mà lúc đau lòng... vẫn chẳng buông tay.
It is also holding on... even when our hearts are breaking.

27
00:02:51,260 --> 00:02:54,840
王建川: 我以為離開，能換你平安，
I thought that by leaving, I could keep you safe.

28
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:57,980
王建川: 卻讓你獨自，熬過了五年。
Yet I left you to endure five bitter years alone.

29
00:02:57,980 --> 00:03:01,740
劉毅: 我不要成全，不要你走遠，
I don't want your sacrifice, nor do I want you far away.

30
00:03:01,740 --> 00:03:05,360
劉毅: 只要你回來，陪在我身邊。
All I want is for you to come back and stay by my side.

31
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:09,000
王建川 × 劉毅: 走過風雨，走過漫長黑夜，
Having weathered the storms and crossed the endless nights,

32
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,700
王建川 × 劉毅: 這一次啊，別再說離別。
This time, my love... let us never speak of farewell again.

33
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:22,100
王建川: Tôi trở về, mang theo bao vết xước,
I came back, bearing the scars of all I'd been through.

34
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:25,780
王建川: Chẳng dám tin... anh vẫn đợi nơi này.
Hardly daring to believe... you were still here, waiting for me.

35
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:29,000
劉毅: Tôi đã trách anh suốt bao mùa xa cách,
I had blamed you through so many seasons of separation.

36
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:32,340
劉毅: Mà gặp lại rồi... chỉ muốn ôm anh thôi.
Yet when we finally met again... all I wanted was to hold you.

37
00:03:32,340 --> 00:03:35,900
王建川: Tôi sợ mai này... lại khiến anh đau.
I'm afraid that someday... I might hurt you again.

38
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:39,500
劉毅: Vậy đừng giấu nữa... mình cùng vượt qua.
Then hide nothing from me anymore... we'll face it all together.

39
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:46,020
王建川 × 劉毅: Từ nay về sau, đừng một mình chịu đựng,
From this day forward, let neither of us suffer alone.

40
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:49,580
王建川 × 劉毅: Đừng thay người kia quyết định chuyện đôi mình.
Let neither of us make decisions for the other about the life we share.

41
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:53,020
王建川 × 劉毅: Năm năm mất rồi... chẳng thể nào lấy lại,
Those five lost years... can never be reclaimed.

42
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:56,540
王建川 × 劉毅: Xin những năm còn lại... được ở bên nhau.
So let us spend the years we have left... by each other's side.

43
00:03:56,540 --> 00:03:59,960
王建川 × 劉毅: Mai tóc bạc thêm, tay run theo năm tháng,
When our hair turns grayer and our hands begin to tremble with age,

44
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:03,440
王建川 × 劉毅: Vẫn có một người... đợi trước hiên nhà.
There will still be someone... waiting on the doorstep.

45
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:06,900
王建川 × 劉毅: Dẫu đời này chẳng cần ai thấu hiểu,
Even if no one else in this world ever understands us,

46
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:12,180
王建川 × 劉毅: Chỉ cần hai ta... còn nhận ra nhau.
All that matters is that we... still recognize each other.

47
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:16,940
王建川 × 劉毅: 山還是山，水還是水，
The mountains are still mountains, the rivers are still rivers.

48
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:20,320
王建川 × 劉毅: 星辰未滅，北風未歇。
The stars have not faded, nor has the northern wind ceased to blow.

49
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:23,860
王建川 × 劉毅: 你還是你，我還是我，
You are still you, and I am still me.

50
00:04:23,860 --> 00:04:27,200
王建川 × 劉毅: 從今以後，你我已是我們。
But from this day forward, you and I have become us.

51
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:30,940
王建川 × 劉毅: 不再放手，不再遠走，
No more letting go, no more wandering far apart.

52
00:04:30,940 --> 00:04:34,160
王建川 × 劉毅: 往後餘生，陪你白頭。
For all the years that remain, I'll stay beside you until our hair turns white.

53
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:37,620
王建川 × 劉毅: 你是我的家，我是你的守候，
You are my home, and I am the one who will always wait for you.

54
00:04:37,620 --> 00:04:43,320
王建川 × 劉毅: 從今以後，一起走到最後。
From this day forward, we'll walk together until the very end.

55
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:50,060
王建川: Mai thức dậy rồi... anh vẫn ở bên tôi.
And when tomorrow comes... you'll still be here beside me.

56
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:57,700
劉毅: Đời này có nhau... là đủ rồi anh.
To have each other in this lifetime... is all I'll ever need, my love.
